# mapcompare — optional API keys
#
# Every key here is OPTIONAL. With none set, the app still ships ~25 keyless layers
# (VersaTiles, Esri World Imagery + Clarity + Wayback, Sentinel-2 cloudless 2017-2025,
# NASA GIBS, OpenFreeMap Liberty). Keyed layers appear greyed out with the reason shown.
#
# These values are compiled into the public JS bundle. They are NOT secrets.
# Restrict every key by HTTP referrer in the provider's dashboard.
#
# You can also paste any of these into Settings at runtime instead of setting them here,
# which is stored in your browser only — see "API keys" in the README.
#
# Copy to .env.development (local) and .env.production (deploy).

# MapTiler — Satellite (global, ~50 cm)
# Key:       https://cloud.maptiler.com/account/keys/
# Free tier: 100,000 requests/month. No credit card.
VITE_MAPTILER_KEY=

# Mapbox — Satellite (global, 50 cm-15 cm, @2x retina, 512 px tiles)
# Key:       https://console.mapbox.com/account/access-tokens/
# Free tier: 750,000 Raster Tiles API requests/month, then $0.25 per 1,000.
# NOTE: consumed via MapLibre rather than Mapbox GL JS, tile requests bill individually
#       under the Maps API instead of bundling into a cheaper "map load". A zoom-heavy
#       session can burn through thousands of requests.
# NOTE: Mapbox's terms require their wordmark logo, not just a text credit.
VITE_MAPBOX_TOKEN=

# Stadia Maps — Alidade Satellite (30 cm over 37M km2, colour-graded)
# Key:       https://client.stadiamaps.com/dashboard/
# Free tier: free for development and non-commercial use, including academic.
VITE_STADIA_API_KEY=

# ArcGIS Location Platform — Imagery (the LICENSED route to Esri imagery)
# Key:       https://location.arcgis.com/  ->  API keys
# Free tier: monthly free allowance on basemap styles. No credit card to start.
# WHY: mapcompare also offers Esri World Imagery keyless, but those endpoints are licensed
#      for use inside ArcGIS Online/Enterprise. Set this token to get the same imagery on
#      terms that actually cover you.
VITE_ARCGIS_API_KEY=

# HERE — satellite.day (global)
# Key:       https://platform.here.com/
# NOTE: the no-credit-card Limited plan was retired 2025-08-31. The Base plan requires a
#       card for its 30,000/month allowance, making this the highest-friction option here.
VITE_HERE_API_KEY=
